{"seq":8,"slug":"logistics-mgmt","title":"物流管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt","introMarkdown":"# 物流管理 简介\n\n物流管理研究的是如何让\"对的货物，在对的时间，以对的成本，到达对的地点\"。它处理的是商品在空间和时间上的位移问题——从工厂仓库到城市门店，从海外港口到你家门口。我们每天网购的包裹能在几天甚至几小时内送达，背后正是一整套精密的物流系统在运转。物流被称为经济活动的\"第三利润源泉\"：在原材料成本和人力成本之外，优化物流是企业挖掘利润的关键空间。\n\n这门学科的魅力在于它把抽象的管理理论落到了实实在在的\"流动\"上。你需要思考一个仓库该建在哪里、一辆卡车该走哪条路线、一批货该备多少库存才不至于断货又不至于积压。这些问题看似琐碎，却直接决定了亚马逊能否次日达、京东能否当日达、顺丰能否做到时效承诺。物流管理把运筹学、信息技术和商业洞察融合在一起，是一门\"既要算得清、又要看得远\"的实践性学科。\n\n本学习空间将物流管理的核心领域组织为四个章节。**第一章 物流管理基础** 建立基本概念框架，讲清物流的定义与功能、物流系统的构成，以及衡量物流绩效的核心指标。**第二章 仓储与库存管理** 深入物流的\"蓄水池\"，讨论仓库的规划布局、库存控制的经典模型，以及现代仓储作业与自动化技术。**第三章 运输与配送** 关注货物的实际移动，涵盖运输方式的选择、车辆路径优化，以及\"最后一公里\"配送的难题与创新。**第四章 现代物流与供应链** 把视野拉高到整条价值链，讨论供应链协同、物流信息技术（条码、RFID、WMS/TMS）以及绿色物流与智慧物流的发展趋势。\n\n物流管理最有效的学习方式是观察与计算并重。建议你在学习每个概念时，找一个真实的场景去对照——追踪一个网购包裹的完整轨迹，估算一家便利店的补货逻辑，或者思考为什么某个外卖订单会迟到。同时，物流中的许多决策都有量化模型支撑，动手算一算订货批量、比一比运输成本，能帮助你真正理解\"权衡\"二字的分量。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-fundamentals","title":"物流管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-logistics","title":"大学物流管理 — 什么是物流","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/what-is-logistics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics-system-and-cost","title":"大学物流管理 — 物流系统与总成本","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-system-and-cost"},{"seq":3,"slug":"logistics-performance-metrics","title":"大学物流管理 — 物流绩效指标","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-performance-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehousing-inventory","title":"仓储与库存管理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"warehouse-planning-operations","title":"大学物流管理 — 仓储规划与作业","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/warehouse-planning-operations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inventory-control-models","title":"大学物流管理 — 库存控制模型","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/inventory-control-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-warehouse-automation","title":"大学物流管理 — 现代仓储与自动化","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/modern-warehouse-automation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"transportation-distribution","title":"运输与配送","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/transportation-distribution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transportation-modes","title":"大学物流管理 — 运输方式选择","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/transportation-distribution/transportation-modes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vehicle-routing","title":"大学物流管理 — 车辆路径规划","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/transportation-distribution/vehicle-routing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"last-mile-delivery","title":"大学物流管理 — 最后一公里配送","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/transportation-distribution/last-mile-delivery"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-logistics-tech","title":"现代物流与供应链","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/modern-logistics-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-coordination","title":"大学物流管理 — 供应链协同","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/modern-logistics-tech/supply-chain-coordination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics-information-technology","title":"大学物流管理 — 物流信息技术","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/modern-logistics-tech/logistics-information-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"green-and-smart-logistics","title":"大学物流管理 — 绿色物流与智慧物流","url":"/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/modern-logistics-tech/green-and-smart-logistics"}]}]}